        "id": 5255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-14T15:05:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Prior to this CL, `surface_draw_test_helper` had a `cleanup_resources` call after running the test, so I would\u0027ve expected we still needed it.\n\nAnd I would\u0027ve expected `WrapAndroidHardwareBuffer` to both `AHardwareBuffer_acquire` and `AHardwareBuffer_release`, but in my quick look before my class is starting, I haven\u0027t been able to confirm.",
      "parentUuid": "b11f8acf_fd3556a9",
